Third-party material
--------------------
- results/candidates/ibm_gross_144_12_12.npz is the [[144,12,12]] gross code of
  Bravyi et al., "High-threshold and low-overhead fault-tolerant quantum memory",
  Nature 627, 778 (2024), arXiv:2308.07915. It is included only as a reference
  baseline. It is not our work, and the CC-BY-4.0 grant above does not cover it.
- qec_search/known_codes.py reproduces code parameters and polynomials from the
  same paper (Table 3), with attribution in the file.
- scripts/certify_upstream.py, scripts/audit_sat_certs.py and
  qec_search/certify_sym.py load Unitary Foundation's verify/sat_certify.py and
  verify/gf2.py (Apache-2.0) at runtime from the enclosing repository; no
  upstream code is copied into lab/.

